name: modl-dataflow-lints
mapping: dataflow
spec: 14.3
expect: contains
=== modl ===
in  hex in.txt
mid triangle
out hex out.txt
in -> mid dashed sort                  # dashed is still a data edge in dataflow
mid -> out &&
#gl mapping=dataflow                   # set last: the lints use the final mapping
=== bash ===
sort < in.txt
=== stderr ===
dashed edge is a data edge in the dataflow mapping
edge text "&&" runs as a command in the dataflow mapping
